    {
      "n": 16,
      "sourceEntry": 221,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Parkes, darling, I love it! I’m so thrilled you talked me into this holiday. Just imagine. Two weeks with you in a caravan. And there’s so much space! Plenty of room for five people. Oh, I love it. I really love it.",
